# CI / Hooks

## Pre-commit (Husky)

`.husky/pre-commit` → `.config/bash/hook-checks.sh` (parity with GHA health + bash + compiler unit):

1. `pnpm btest` — bash suite (`bash.yaml`)
2. `pnpm check` — Biome
3. `pnpm typeslint` — `tsc` for `@nucleify/web`
4. `pnpm slint` — Stylelint
5. `pnpm build` — Nuxt production build (`health-check` build job)
6. `pnpm tests` — Vitest
7. `pnpm compiler:test` — compiler unit tests
8. `pnpm compiler:check` — emit fingerprints
9. `pnpm compiler:convert:check` — convert matrix (web|admin × next|solid|svelte) + shell builds

Same convert matrix also runs in `.github/workflows/compiler.yaml`.

## Pre-push

`.husky/pre-push` is a no-op (`exit 0`). Do not re-run the suite here.

## GitHub Actions

### `health-check.yml` (all branches)

Node 22, pnpm. Parallel jobs after setup: biome, typeslint, stylelint, build, test.

### `bash.yaml`

Runs `bash .config/bash/tests/run.sh` on push.

### `compiler.yaml`

Unit (`compiler:test` / `compiler:check` / idempotent build) plus emit + convert product-shell matrices.
